"A clear step up in quality from E2B — better at longer conversations, writing, and coding — while still replying quickly. A great all-around default if you're not sure what to pick." = "相比 E2B 是质量上的明显提升 —— 更擅长长对话、写作和编码 —— 同时回复依然迅速。如果你不确定选哪个，这是各方面都很出色的默认选择。";
