"A few seconds of clean speech works best. Answers are synthesized locally by the Audio pane's TTS model (downloaded on first use)." = "几秒钟清晰的语音效果最好。回答由音频面板的 TTS 模型在本地合成（首次使用时下载）。";
"A frontier-scale DeepSeek model that runs natively on Apple Silicon through MLX — no GGUF conversion, no llama.cpp — for top-tier reasoning, coding, and agent work. It wakes only a fraction of itself per word (mixture of experts) and holds around a million words of context. This is our own iQ-MLX conversion at 3.3 bits per weight, about 130 GB on disk, so it wants a Mac with 128 GB of memory (raise the GPU wired limit and close other apps to fit a useful context); it also ships DeepSeek's own DSpark draft stages, which Settings can switch on for a faster reply on Macs with more than 128 GB." = "一个前沿规模的 DeepSeek 模型，通过 MLX 在 Apple Silicon 上原生运行 —— 无需 GGUF 转换，也不依赖 llama.cpp —— 适用于顶级推理、编码和 Agent 工作。它每处理一个词只唤醒自身的一小部分（混合专家），并能容纳约一百万个词的上下文。这是我们自己转换的 iQ-MLX 版本，每权重 3.3 bits，磁盘占用约 130 GB，因此需要一台 128 GB 内存的 Mac（请提高 GPU 的 wired limit 并关闭其他应用，以容纳可用的上下文）；它还附带 DeepSeek 自己的 DSpark 草稿阶段，在内存超过 128 GB 的 Mac 上可在设置中开启，以获得更快的回答。";
"A goal the agent runs on its own, on a schedule." = "由 Agent 按计划自行执行的目标。";
"A larger voice model for more natural, expressive speech — 8-bit keeps the download and memory reasonable." = "更大的语音模型，语音更自然、更有表现力 —— 8-bit 让下载和内存占用保持适中。";
"A larger, high-fidelity image model tuned for photorealistic results in just a few steps — best when quality matters more than download size." = "更大的高保真图像模型，只需几步即可生成照片级效果 —— 适合质量比下载体积更重要的场景。";
"A light touch: the model takes the overall feel and timbre from up to 30 seconds of the clip, it does not recreate the song." = "轻度处理：模型只从最多 30 秒的片段中提取整体感觉与音色，不会重新演绎整首歌曲。";
"A memory-for-speed trade, not a free upgrade: shrinks KV-cache RAM (8-bit ≈ 2× smaller, 4-bit ≈ 4×) but makes decode ~10% slower at typical contexts — and slower still on long ones, since every generated token pays a dequantize step. Turn on when memory is the constraint (long contexts or big models on a 16 GB Mac); leave OFF for maximum tokens/sec if you have plenty of RAM." = "用内存换速度的取舍，不是免费的升级：缩小 KV-cache 内存占用（8-bit ≈ 缩小 2×，4-bit ≈ 缩小 4×），但会让典型上下文下的解码慢约 10% —— 长上下文下更慢，因为每个生成的 Token 都要付出一次反量化步骤。当内存成为瓶颈时开启（长上下文，或 16 GB Mac 上跑大模型）；内存充裕、想追求最高 tokens/sec 就保持关闭。";
"A much larger model that uses a trick called “mixture of experts” — for every word it only wakes up a small part of itself, so it answers faster than you'd expect for its size while giving noticeably better answers than the smaller Gemma models." = "一个更大的模型，用了叫作“混合专家”的技巧 —— 每处理一个词它只唤醒自身的一小部分，因此回答速度比它的体量所暗示的更快，同时给出的答案明显优于较小的 Gemma 模型。";
"A new track from the style prompt and lyrics." = "根据风格提示词和歌词生成一首新曲。";
"A run measures the server exactly as configured. These are recorded with every result." = "每次运行都严格按当前配置测量服务器。这些配置会随每条结果一并记录。";
"A single, well-lit photo of one object works best. The subject is auto-cut from its background." = "一张光线充足、只含一个物体的照片效果最佳。主体会自动从背景中抠出。";
"A small, very fast model (about 17x realtime, a tenth of the memory of the cloning model) with 54 built-in voices you can blend. It can't copy your voice." = "一个体积小、速度非常快的模型（约为实时的 17 倍，内存占用是语音克隆模型的十分之一），内置 54 种可混合的音色。它无法复制你的声音。";
"A tiny, very fast voice model with 54 built-in voices you can blend together. No cloning — pick or mix a voice instead." = "小巧且非常快的语音模型，内置 54 种可混合的声音。不支持克隆 —— 请选择或混合一种声音。";
"A well-rounded Qwen model — good at chatting, coding help, and following instructions, while staying quick to respond. A solid alternative to Gemma if you want to compare styles." = "一款均衡的 Qwen 模型 —— 擅长聊天、编码辅助和指令遵循，同时保持快速响应。如果你想比较不同风格，它是 Gemma 之外可靠的选择。";
