"Hot prefix cache size: how many separate KV snapshots to keep across requests. Lets multi-turn chats skip re-prefilling shared system prompts. 0 disables. Auto-capped on RAM-limited Macs (a 16 GB Mac caps to 1) — on hybrid SSM models each entry pins large KV + state snapshots that can otherwise fill memory." = "热前缀缓存大小：跨请求保留多少个独立的 KV 快照。让多轮聊天无需重新预填充共享的系统提示词。0 表示禁用。在内存受限的 Mac 上会自动设上限（16 GB 的 Mac 上限为 1） —— 在混合 SSM 模型上，每个条目都会固定占用大量 KV + 状态快照，否则可能占满内存。";
"How can I help you today?" = "今天我能帮你做什么？";
"How closely the picture follows the attached soundtrack. LTX default: 7.0." = "画面贴合所附音轨的程度。LTX 默认：7.0。";
"How hard the video is pushed to match your clip — lip sync, timing, performance. 7.0 is the LTX default. Lower drifts from the audio; higher locks to it and can look stiff." = "视频向你的音频片段对齐的强度 —— 唇形同步、时间轴、表演。7.0 是 LTX 的默认值。调低会逐渐偏离音频；调高会紧贴音频，可能显得僵硬。";
"How large each reference image is fed to the model. Maximum detail keeps identity better and is several times slower — every reference token is re-read on every sampling step." = "每张参考图送入模型的尺寸。最高细节能更好地保持人物一致性，但会慢上数倍 —— 每个采样步都要重新读取全部参考 Token。";
"How many requests llama.cpp decodes at once, in one batch, each keeping its own prompt cache warm. Agent clients send several requests together; with 1 they wait in line. Each sequence holds a full context of KV memory from the moment the model loads, so lower it if a large context does not fit. Passes --llama-cache-entries." = "llama.cpp 同时在一个批次中解码多少个请求，每个请求各自保留热的提示词缓存。Agent 客户端会同时发送多个请求；设为 1 时它们只能排队。每个序列从模型加载起就占用一整个上下文的 KV 内存，所以大上下文放不下时请调低。对应 --llama-cache-entries。";
"How many models the server keeps resident before it evicts the least-recently-used one to make room for the next. Switching models in the composer's picker never explicitly unloads the old one — it relies on this cap. Set to 1 so every switch unloads the previous model first, freeing its memory immediately. Passes --max-resident-models." = "服务器在换出最久未使用的模型为新模型腾出空间之前，会常驻多少个模型。在输入框的模型选择器中切换模型从不会显式卸载旧模型 —— 它依赖这个上限。设为 1 后，每次切换都会先卸载上一个模型，立即释放它的内存。会传递 --max-resident-models。";
"How many of the steps follow the source. 1 keeps it all the way; lower lets the caption take over for the last steps." = "有多少步跟随源音频。1 表示全程跟随；数值更低时，最后几步由描述文本主导。";
"How many times this repo has been pulled from HuggingFace" = "该仓库从 HuggingFace 拉取的次数";
"How many tokens the MTP head guesses per step. Automatic (recommended) tunes this live — it guesses deeper while the model keeps accepting the guesses and backs off when it doesn't. Pick a fixed number only if you're measuring performance." = "MTP 头每步猜测多少个 Token。自动（推荐）会实时调整 —— 只要模型持续接受猜测就更深地猜测，不接受时就收敛。只有在你做性能测量时才选一个固定数字。";
"How the app looks and how you summon the Quick Launcher. Applies immediately — no restart needed." = "应用的外观以及唤出快速启动器的方式。立即生效 —— 无需重启。";
"How wide a conversation reads. Narrow and Medium are fixed widths, so resizing the window moves the margins rather than the text; Wide follows the window. Also on ⌘⌥1-3, under View ▸ Interface." = "对话的阅读宽度。窄与中等为固定宽度，调整窗口大小时边距随之变化而文字宽度不变；宽则跟随窗口。也可在「显示 ▸ 界面」中用 ⌘⌥1-3 切换。";
"Hugging Face Cache" = "Hugging Face 缓存";
"Hunyuan 3 295B-A21B (2-bit)" = "Hunyuan 3 295B-A21B（2-bit）";
"Hunyuan3D 2.1 has no download yet — convert the weights on-device with tests/convert_hunyuan3d_weights.py (see the repo README). They install to ~/.mlx-serve/models/local/." = "Hunyuan3D 2.1 暂无下载 —— 请用 tests/convert_hunyuan3d_weights.py 在本机转换权重（见仓库 README）。转换结果会安装到 ~/.mlx-serve/models/local/。";
