"MiniMax's full-song model: an 8B language model writes the music frame by frame from your style prompt and lyrics, then a diffusion decoder renders it. Slower than ACE-Step, strongest vocals." = "MiniMax 的完整歌曲模型：一个 8B 语言模型根据你的风格提示词和歌词逐帧写出音乐，再由扩散解码器渲染。比 ACE-Step 慢，人声最强。";
"MiniMax-H3 (Hailuo 3.0) 4-bit — video + native audio, low RAM" = "MiniMax-H3（海螺 3.0）4-bit —— 视频 + 原生音频，低内存";
"MiniMax-H3 (Hailuo 3.0) 8-bit — video + native audio" = "MiniMax-H3（海螺 3.0）8-bit —— 视频 + 原生音频";
"MiniMax-H3 (Hailuo 3.0) REF2VA 8-bit — references + native audio" = "MiniMax-H3（海螺 3.0）REF2VA 8-bit —— 参考素材 + 原生音频";
"MiniMax-H3 REF2VA expects six labelled sections in order — subject_definitions:, summary:, retention_analysis: (what to DO with each reference), detailed_description:, overall_soundscape:, non_diegetic_music:. Refer to attachments as <Picture 1>, <Video 1>, <Audio 1>. Click Examples above." = "MiniMax-H3 REF2VA 要求按顺序提供六个带标签的小节 —— subject_definitions:、summary:、retention_analysis:（每个参考素材要做什么）、detailed_description:、overall_soundscape:、non_diegetic_music:。引用附件时写作 <Picture 1>、<Video 1>、<Audio 1>。请点击上方的示例。";
"MiniMax-H3 REF2VA expects six labelled sections in order — subject_definitions:, summary:, retention_analysis: (what to keep from each reference), detailed_description:, overall_soundscape:, and non_diegetic_music:." = "MiniMax-H3 REF2VA 需要六个带标签的段落，且按顺序书写 —— subject_definitions:、summary:、retention_analysis:（每份参考要保留什么）、detailed_description:、overall_soundscape: 与 non_diegetic_music:。";
"MiniMax-H3 REF2VA was trained on detailed shot descriptions. Try Examples above." = "MiniMax-H3 REF2VA 是在详细的镜头描述上训练的。试试上方的示例。";
"MiniMax-H3 REF2VA was trained on six labelled sections starting with “%@”. retention_analysis: is what states each reference's role. Try Examples or Prompt tips above." = "MiniMax-H3 REF2VA 是在六个带标签的段落上训练的，以“%@”开头。retention_analysis: 用来说明每份参考的作用。可试试上方的「示例」或「提示词技巧」。";
"MiniMax-H3 expects three labelled fields — integrated_multimodal_description: (the shot, its style, action and camera movement), overall_soundscape: (ambience and physical sound), non_diegetic_music: (score only the audience hears, or N/A). Click Examples above for the exact shape." = "MiniMax-H3 要求三个带标签的字段 —— integrated_multimodal_description:（镜头本身及其风格、动作和运镜）、overall_soundscape:（环境音与实体音效）、non_diegetic_music:（只有观众听到的配乐，或 N/A）。点击上方的示例查看确切格式。";
"MiniMax-H3 expects three labelled fields — integrated_multimodal_description: (the shot, its style, action and camera movement), overall_soundscape: (ambience, effects and music beds), and non_diegetic_music: (what the audience hears but the characters do not). Write them in that order." = "MiniMax-H3 需要三个带标签的字段 —— integrated_multimodal_description:（镜头及其风格、动作与运镜）、overall_soundscape:（环境声、音效与音乐铺底），以及 non_diegetic_music:（观众能听到而角色听不到的音乐）。请按此顺序书写。";
"MiniMax-H3 was trained on detailed shot descriptions — style, action, camera movement and sound. Try Examples above." = "MiniMax-H3 是在详细的镜头描述上训练的 —— 包括风格、动作、运镜和声音。试试上方的示例。";
