"OFF" = "关闭";
"OFF = plain chat (safe). ON = the bot can run shell commands and read/write files on this Mac, triggered from your phone. Confined to ~/.mlx-serve/telegram-workspace. Only enable if you understand the risk — anyone who can message the locked chat gets this power." = "关闭 = 纯聊天（安全）。开启 = 机器人可以执行 shell 命令并读写这台 Mac 上的文件，且可由你的手机触发。范围限制在 ~/.mlx-serve/telegram-workspace。请仅在清楚风险时开启 —— 任何能给这个已锁定的聊天发消息的人都将获得该权限。";
"OFF = the agent runs shell commands directly on macOS (fast, full access to your files). ON = commands run inside an isolated Linux sandbox that can only touch the current working folder, so a bad command can't harm the rest of your Mac. Costs a bit more memory while active because it spins up a lightweight virtual machine for the session." = "关闭 = Agent 直接在 macOS 上执行 shell 命令（更快，可访问你的全部文件）。开启 = 命令在隔离的 Linux 沙盒中执行，只能访问当前工作文件夹，因此一条出错的命令不会波及其他部分。启用期间会多占一些内存，因为要为该会话启动一台轻量虚拟机。";
"OK" = "好";
"ON" = "开启";
"ON = the sandbox has outbound internet (NAT), and any server the agent starts inside it is automatically reachable on this Mac at localhost with the same port — e.g. a dev server on 8080 appears at localhost:8080 (bound to localhost only, never your LAN). OFF = the sandbox gets no network device at all: fully isolated, but installs and downloads inside it will fail. Applies to the next sandbox session." = "开启 = 沙盒可访问外网（NAT），Agent 在其中启动的服务器会自动以相同端口映射到这台 Mac 的 localhost——例如沙盒里 8080 上的开发服务器可在 localhost:8080 访问（仅绑定 localhost，绝不暴露到局域网）。关闭 = 沙盒没有任何网络设备：完全隔离，但其中的安装与下载都会失败。对下一个沙盒会话生效。";
"ON = tools are opt-in: a chat only gets them when you turn the wrench (or MCP) on yourself, and sending a message that looks like a task — \"make me a website\", \"npm install react\" — no longer stops to ask whether to enable Tools or MCP first. OFF = that suggestion still appears before such a message is sent. Either way the toolbar toggles, and any agent that decides them for its tab, are unchanged." = "开启 = 工具改为手动选择：只有你亲自打开扳手（或 MCP）时，聊天才会获得工具；发送看起来像任务的消息（“帮我做个网站”“npm install react”）时，不会再停下来先问是否启用 Tools 或 MCP。关闭 = 发送这类消息之前仍会出现该提示。无论哪种，工具栏开关以及由各 Agent 自行决定的设置都不变。";
"ON in another chat — click to move it here" = "已在另一个聊天中开启 —— 点击移到这里";
"ON in this chat" = "本聊天已开启";
"Off" = "关闭";
"Off (F16, libllama default)" = "关闭（F16，libllama 默认）";
"Off (bf16)" = "关闭（bf16）";
"Off (default): the fast recipe — step caching + attention reuse, about 2.8x faster at 768p. On: every denoising step is fully computed; marginally better detail for final renders, and it drops the step cache, which is what makes a long clip fit in memory. Turbo runs without the recipe anyway, so this has nothing to add there." = "关闭（默认）：使用快速配方 —— 步缓存 + 注意力复用，768p 下约快 2.8 倍。开启：每个去噪步都完整计算，最终成片细节略好，但会放弃步缓存，而步缓存正是长片段能放进内存的原因。Turbo 本来就不走这个配方，因此对它没有区别。";
"Off (default): the fast recipe — step caching + attention reuse, about 2.8x faster at 768p. On: every denoising step is fully computed; marginally better detail for final renders." = "关闭（默认）：快速方案 —— 步数缓存 + 注意力复用，在 768p 下约快 2.8 倍。开启：每个去噪步骤都完整计算；最终渲染的细节略有提升。";
"Off (default): the plain convolutional decoder. On: LTX's own diffusion decoder — the one their published clips use. It denoises the frames instead of interpolating them, so fine texture and edges come out sharper. The decode itself takes about 21 s for a 97-frame clip at 768x512; measured end to end against the plain decoder in the same session the difference was inside run-to-run variance." = "关闭（默认）：普通卷积解码器。开启：LTX 自家的扩散解码器 —— 也就是他们发布的片段所用的那个。它对帧做去噪而非插值，因此细部纹理与边缘更锐利。解码本身对 768x512 的 97 帧片段约需 21 秒；在同一会话中与普通解码器做端到端对比，差异落在多次运行的波动范围之内。";
"Off (dense bf16)" = "关闭（稠密 bf16）";
"Off by default: every start, automatic or from the Start Server button, comes up with no model resident and loads one on demand at your first message, so login stays fast. On pays for the load up front. A large checkpoint can take a while and holds the memory from the moment the server is up." = "默认关闭：无论自动启动还是点击「启动服务器」，启动时都不常驻任何模型，而是在你发出第一条消息时按需加载，因此启动更快。开启则需预先承担加载开销：大检查点可能耗时较久，并且从服务器启动那一刻起就占用内存。";
