"On: each denoising step sends a small still built by projecting the latent straight to RGB — enough to see the shot taking form, but flat and soft compared with the finished clip, which is decoded by the VAE. Off (default): no preview. It is not free — every step solves for the clean latent and copies the previewed frame to the CPU." = "开：每个去噪步都会发送一张小尺寸静帧，由潜变量直接投影到 RGB 得到 —— 足以看清画面逐渐成形，但相比由 VAE 解码的成片，它更平、更软。关（默认）：不显示预览。预览并非没有代价 —— 每一步都要解出干净的潜变量，并把预览帧复制到 CPU。";
"On: the model stays resident so the next generation is instant. Off (default): it's unloaded to free GPU memory." = "开启：模型常驻内存，下一次生成即刻开始。关闭（默认）：卸载模型以释放 GPU 内存。";
"One of the most capable models this app can run — excellent at coding and at multi-step “agent” tasks like using tools and following a plan, and it reads images too. It also ships with a built-in speed trick that lets it draft and double-check several words at once, so it feels noticeably faster than a plain model this size." = "本应用能运行的最强模型之一 —— 擅长编码，也擅长使用工具、按计划执行这类多步“Agent”任务，而且还能读图。它还内置了一项加速技巧，可以一次草拟并复核多个词，因此体感上明显比同规模的普通模型更快。";
