"Qwen 3.5 / 3.8 models that ship a trained MTP head guess several of the next tokens at once and check them all in a single pass — typically a big speed-up on replies, with output identical to normal decoding. It switches on by itself for models that have the head, and does nothing for models that don't, so there's rarely a reason to turn it off." = "自带训练好的 MTP 头的 Qwen 3.5 / 3.8 模型会一次猜出后面的若干 Token，并在单次传递中全部校验 —— 通常能大幅加快回复速度，且输出与常规解码完全一致。对于有该头的模型它会自动开启，对没有的模型则不起作用，因此几乎没有理由关闭它。";
"Qwen 3.8 27B (4-bit, MTP)" = "Qwen 3.8 27B（4-bit，MTP）";
"Qwen 3.8 27B squeezed down to about 2 bits per weight by prism-ml, so one of the strongest models here fits a Mac with 16 GB of memory. It gives up some accuracy against the full-size 27B and replies slower on a small Mac, but it is far smarter than anything else that fits in 16 GB. It reads images too, and uses the same built-in speed trick as the 27B." = "由 prism-ml 将 Qwen 3.8 27B 压缩到每个权重约 2 位，让这里最强的模型之一可以在 16 GB 内存的 Mac 上运行。与完整的 27B 相比它会损失一些准确度，在小内存 Mac 上回复也更慢，但比其他能放进 16 GB 的模型聪明得多。它也能读图片，并使用与 27B 相同的内置提速技巧。";
"Qwen's largest model here — 125 billion parameters, of which it wakes only about 6 billion per word (mixture of experts), so it answers at a pace closer to a mid-size model than to one this big. Reasoning, coding and agent work at the same level as DeepSeek-V4-Flash, it reads images, and it ships with a built-in speed trick that drafts and double-checks several words at once. This is our own mixed 4/8-bit build, about 100 GB on disk, of which a 32 GB lookup table stays on disk while it runs, so it fits a Mac with 96 GB of memory." = "这是 Qwen 在此最大的模型 —— 1250 亿参数，但每个词只唤醒其中约 60 亿（MoE），因此它的作答速度更接近中等规模模型，而非这个体量的模型。推理、编码和 Agent 工作与 DeepSeek-V4-Flash 处于同一水平，它能读图，并内置了一项可一次草拟并复核多个词的加速技巧。这是我们自制的 4/8-bit 混合构建版本，磁盘上约 100 GB，运行时其中 32 GB 的查找表留在磁盘上，因此可在 96 GB 内存的 Mac 上运行。";
"Qwen's mixture-of-experts model — 35 billion parameters in total, but like the Gemma mixture-of-experts model above, it only activates a few billion per word. It ships with a built-in speed trick that drafts and double-checks several words at once, which makes it the fastest model on this list by a wide margin. Excellent for demanding coding and reasoning work." = "Qwen 的 MoE 模型 —— 总共 350 亿参数，但与上文 Gemma 的 MoE 模型一样，每个词只激活其中几十亿。它内置了一项可一次草拟并复核多个词的加速技巧，因此是这份列表中快出一大截的最快模型。非常适合高强度的编码和推理工作。";
"Qwen-Image 2.1 quantized to 4-bit for smaller Macs — the same 40-step model at about half the memory, with some loss of fine detail. Open (Apache-2.0)." = "为小内存 Mac 量化为 4-bit 的 Qwen-Image 2.1 —— 同样是 40 步模型，内存占用约为一半，细节略有损失。开源（Apache-2.0）。";
