"Runs part of image generation on the Neural Engine alongside the GPU. Measured 1.30x on an M4 Max and 1.77x on an M1 Pro with Krea — smaller Macs gain more, since every Mac has the same 16-core Neural Engine and only the GPU scales. The split is solved per Mac and model at the first request, which adds a one-time compile of about a minute. Off by default; the server declines by name when this Mac cannot hold it." = "在 GPU 之外，把部分图像生成放到神经引擎上运行。在 M4 Max 上用 Krea 实测为 1.30x，在 M1 Pro 上为 1.77x —— 较小的 Mac 收益更大，因为每台 Mac 的神经引擎都是相同的 16 核，只有 GPU 会随机型变化。拆分方案会在首次请求时按 Mac 和模型单独求解，这会带来约一分钟的一次性编译。默认关闭；当这台 Mac 放不下时，服务器会指名拒绝。";
"Runs part of long-prompt processing on the Apple Neural Engine in parallel with the GPU, so big prompts start answering sooner — measured 19–26% faster prompt processing at 16k–32k tokens on an M4 Max with Qwen family models (4, 6 and 8-bit builds alike). Reply speed is unchanged. The server checks the exact fit at load and declines by name when this Mac can't hold it. First load of a model adds a one-time compile of about 1–2 minutes. Models it can't accelerate simply serve normally. Not recommended on M5-family Macs yet: their GPUs carry neural accelerator (NAX) cores that already speed up prompt processing, so the Neural Engine's extra help shrinks to little or nothing there." = "在 GPU 之外，把部分长提示词处理并行放到 Apple 神经引擎上运行，让大提示词更快开始作答 —— 在 M4 Max 上用 Qwen 系列模型（4、6、8-bit 构建版本均如此）实测，16k–32k Token 时提示词处理快 19–26%。回复速度不变。服务器会在加载时检查是否精确放得下，当这台 Mac 放不下时会指名拒绝。模型首次加载会增加约 1–2 分钟的一次性编译。无法加速的模型照常提供服务。暂不建议在 M5 系列 Mac 上使用：它们的 GPU 带有神经加速器（NAX）核心，已经能加速提示词处理，因此神经引擎的额外帮助在那里微乎其微甚至为零。";
"Runs part of music generation on the Neural Engine alongside the GPU. Measured 1.33x on an M4 Max, 1.58x on an M4 base — smaller Macs gain more, since every Mac has the same 16-core Neural Engine and only the GPU scales. Off by default; the server declines by name when this Mac cannot hold it." = "在 GPU 之外，把部分音乐生成放到神经引擎上运行。在 M4 Max 上实测为 1.33x，在 M4 基础款上为 1.58x —— 较小的 Mac 收益更大，因为每台 Mac 的神经引擎都是相同的 16 核，只有 GPU 会随机型变化。默认关闭；当这台 Mac 放不下时，服务器会指名拒绝。";
"Runs part of video generation on the Neural Engine alongside the GPU. Measured 1.22x per denoise step on an M4 Max with MiniMax-H3. The split is solved per Mac and model; H3 rebuilds it per request (about 30 s cold, 8 s warm), so it pays on long renders. Blocks that carry a LoRA (the Turbo recipe) stay on the GPU. Off by default; the server declines by name when this Mac cannot hold it." = "在 GPU 之外，把部分视频生成放到神经引擎上运行。在 M4 Max 上用 MiniMax-H3 实测，每个去噪步骤快 1.22x。拆分方案按 Mac 和模型单独求解；H3 会在每次请求时重建它（冷启动约 30 s，热启动 8 s），因此长时间渲染时更划算。带 LoRA 的模块（Turbo 配方）保留在 GPU 上。默认关闭；当这台 Mac 放不下时，服务器会指名拒绝。";
"Runs the Turbo distillation LoRA: 4 steps instead of 30, about twice as fast end to end. Slightly softer detail and harder light than a full render. The adapter ships with the model; packs downloaded before it existed fetch it once, on the first run with this on." = "运行 Turbo 蒸馏 LoRA：用 4 步取代 30 步，端到端约快一倍。与完整渲染相比，细节略柔和、光线略偏硬。该适配器随模型一同提供；在此功能出现之前下载的包，会在首次开启时获取一次。";
