"Text-to-speech, with optional voice cloning." = "文字转语音，可选声音克隆。";
"Text/image-to-video, with optional audio." = "文字/图片生成视频，可选音频。";
"Texture (PBR)" = "纹理（PBR）";
"That folder isn't reachable right now, so downloads are going to %@ instead." = "该文件夹目前无法访问，因此下载会改为保存到 %@。";
"That is the server MLX-Serve is running — add an mlx-serve on a different port" = "那是 MLX-Serve 正在运行的服务器 —— 请在另一个端口上添加 mlx-serve";
"That wake phrase is taken" = "该唤醒词已被占用";
"The %@ session could not start" = "%@ 会话无法启动";
"The 27B, sized for 16 GB" = "为 16 GB 精简的 27B";
"The 4-bit build of MiniMax-H3: same generation speed, a 40 GB download instead of 69, and it fits comfortably on 32 GB Macs. Slightly softer detail than the 8-bit build — pick that one if you have 48 GB or more." = "MiniMax-H3 的 4-bit 版本：生成速度相同，下载 40 GB 而不是 69 GB，32 GB 的 Mac 也能轻松运行。细节比 8-bit 版本略柔和 —— 如果你有 48 GB 或以上内存，请选 8-bit。";
"The C bindings the server links MLX through (pinned submodule revision)." = "服务器用来链接 MLX 的 C 绑定（固定子模块版本）。";
"The answer did not use the planted constant" = "回答没有使用植入的常量";
"The answer used the constant planted in the context" = "回答使用了植入上下文中的常量";
"The bigger FLUX.2-klein — stronger prompt following and detail than the 4B, with the same fast schedule and the same instruction editing. Twice the download and memory." = "更大的 FLUX.2-klein —— 提示词遵循和细节都强于 4B，同样快速的采样调度和指令编辑。下载和内存翻倍。";
"The built-in macOS voice. No download and no GPU, but the least natural of the three." = "内置的 macOS 音色。无需下载，也不占用 GPU，但三者中最不自然。";
"The community database hasn't been created yet. See docs/benchmarks-setup.md for the one-time Firebase setup." = "社区数据库尚未创建。一次性 Firebase 配置步骤见 docs/benchmarks-setup.md。";
"The community database rejected the request. Its security rules may not be deployed yet — see docs/benchmarks-setup.md." = "社区数据库拒绝了该请求。其安全规则可能尚未部署 —— 详见 docs/benchmarks-setup.md。";
"The community database returned HTTP %lld. Try again in a moment." = "社区数据库返回 HTTP %lld。请稍后重试。";
"The default working folder for the agent's tools (shell, readFile, writeFile, …) in every chat — and the folder shared into the sandbox VM at /workspace while the sandbox is on. Changing it moves chats still on the previous default, remounts a running sandbox, and restarts any open terminal sessions in the new folder; a chat with its own picked folder (the folder icon on the Agent pill) keeps it." = "每个聊天中 Agent 工具（shell、readFile、writeFile 等）的默认工作文件夹 —— 沙盒开启时，该文件夹也会挂载到沙盒虚拟机的 /workspace。更改后，仍在使用旧默认值的聊天会随之切换，运行中的沙盒会重新挂载，已打开的终端会话会在新文件夹中重启；自行指定过文件夹的聊天（Agent 胶囊上的文件夹图标）保持原样。";
"The document index is still being prepared (resolving the embedding model). Wait a moment and search again." = "文档索引仍在准备中（正在解析嵌入模型）。请稍候片刻再搜索。";
"The downloaded disk image contains no app bundle" = "下载的磁盘映像中不包含应用包";
"The edit comes back at the source image's own size." = "编辑结果会按源图自身的尺寸返回。";
"The fastest model here" = "这里最快的模型";
"The file is kept at %@." = "文件已保留在 %@。";
"The first chat that messages the bot is adopted as the owner; everyone else is refused. Reset to hand the bot to a different chat." = "第一个给机器人发消息的会话会被设为主人；其他所有会话都会被拒绝。重置后可把机器人交给另一个会话。";
"The global combo that summons the Quick Launcher (⌃Space by default) from any app. Must include at least one modifier key." = "在任意应用中唤起快速启动器的全局组合键（默认 ⌃Space）。必须至少包含一个修饰键。";
"The highest-fidelity voice model here, at full precision — best for expressive, long-form narration when you have the RAM to spare." = "这里保真度最高的全精度语音模型 —— 内存充足时最适合富有表现力的长篇朗读。";
"The icon top-right: start the server, switch models, talk." = "右上角的图标：启动服务器、切换模型、对话。";
"The lightest voice model — quick to generate speech and clone a voice from a short reference clip, with a small memory footprint." = "最轻的语音模型 —— 快速生成语音，并能从短参考片段克隆声音，内存占用小。";
"The model advertises a %lld-token context; %@ needs %lld+ to work well. Raise Context size in Settings ▸ Server, or expect compaction and truncated turns." = "模型声明 %lld Token 的上下文；%@ 需要 %lld 以上才能良好工作。请在设置 ▸ 服务器中调高上下文长度，否则可能触发压缩并截断对话轮次。";
"The model could not be loaded. Check the server log." = "模型加载失败。请检查服务器日志。";
"The model invents a soundtrack from your prompt. Attach speech to make characters say exact words." = "模型会根据你的提示词自行创作配乐。附加语音可让角色说出指定台词。";
"The model is loaded when the run starts." = "模型会在运行开始时加载。";
"The name other Macs see next to your shared models. Blank = this Mac's hostname." = "其他 Mac 在你的共享模型旁看到的名字。留空 = 这台 Mac 的主机名。";
"The newest LTX. Generates short video clips with sound from a text prompt, and optionally a starting image or audio track. Ships its own text encoder, so nothing extra downloads on first use." = "最新的 LTX。根据文字提示词（可选起始图片或音轨）生成带声音的短视频片段。自带文本编码器，首次使用无需额外下载。";
"The reference recording was empty." = "参考录音是空的。";
"The reference-conditioned MiniMax-H3: attach up to 9 images, 3 clips and 3 audio references and the generation follows them for character, style and scene continuity. Refer to them in the prompt as <Picture 1>, <Video 1>, <Audio 1>. Same speed and soundtrack as the standard pack; every reference adds tokens to every sampling step, so more references means slower." = "参考条件化的 MiniMax-H3：最多可附加 9 张图片、3 段视频和 3 段音频参考，生成时会依据它们保持角色、风格与场景的连贯。在提示词中以 <Picture 1>、<Video 1>、<Audio 1> 引用它们。速度与音轨和标准权重包相同；每份参考都会给每个采样步增加 Token，因此参考越多越慢。";
"The same Gemma mixture-of-experts model as above, stored with twice the numeric precision (8-bit instead of 4-bit). That means slightly more accurate, consistent answers, at roughly double the memory." = "与上文相同的 Gemma MoE 模型，但以两倍的数值精度存储（8-bit 而非 4-bit）。这意味着答案略更准确、更稳定，但内存大约翻倍。";
"The same small voice model at full precision — slightly more accurate output than the 8-bit build, at a bit more memory." = "同一个小型语音模型的全精度版本 —— 输出比 8-bit 版本略准确，内存稍多。";
"The second pass sharpens the upscaled frames. Auto is the reference schedule. More steps clean up detail and cost time; fewer are faster and softer." = "第二遍会锐化放大后的帧。自动即参考调度。步数更多会让细节更干净，但更耗时；更少则更快、更柔和。";
"The server comes up as soon as the app does. Off means you start it from the tray." = "应用启动后立即启动服务器。关闭则需从托盘手动启动。";
"The server is loading this model…" = "服务器正在加载此模型…";
"The server is started with this model when the run starts." = "运行开始时会用这个模型启动服务器。";
"The server isn't running — the task will start it on its first run." = "服务器未运行 —— 任务首次运行时会自动启动它。";
"The server isn't running, so nothing can answer. Click to start it." = "服务器未运行，无法应答。点击启动。";
"Free RAM the server leaves out of its plans so macOS always has room. Auto is an eighth of your RAM (2 to 8 GB). A smaller size, or Off, gives models more context and admits more requests at once, but on a small Mac under heavy load less reserve can freeze or restart the machine." = "服务器在规划中留出的空闲内存，让 macOS 始终有余量。自动为内存的八分之一（2 到 8 GB）。更小的余量或关闭可让模型获得更多上下文、同时接纳更多请求，但在小内存 Mac 高负载时，余量过少可能造成系统卡死或重启。";
"The session running inside the sandbox will be terminated. Files it wrote are kept." = "沙盒中运行的会话将被终止。它写入的文件会保留。";
"The sharpest LTX we ship. Same model as the 4-bit pack at twice the weight precision — noticeably more detail in faces, fur and fine texture, for about the same generation time. Needs a Mac with plenty of memory." = "我们提供的最清晰的 LTX。与 4-bit 包是同一模型，但权重精度翻倍 —— 面部、毛发和细腻纹理的细节明显更多，生成时间大致相同。需要内存充足的 Mac。";
"The smallest rung's decode, measured again after the whole ladder. Beyond ±10% the run's numbers are a range, not figures." = "最小档位的解码速度，在整个阶梯测试结束后再测一次。超过 ±10% 时，本次结果只是一个范围，而不是确切数值。";
"The source image does not fit this model." = "源图片不适合此模型。";
"The sweet spot" = "最佳平衡点";
"The task run failed." = "任务运行失败。";
"The tensor library under the llama.cpp GGUF engine (with its short commit)." = "llama.cpp GGUF 引擎底层的张量库（含其短提交号）。";
"The tool-calling loop: shell, files, search, tasks, media generation." = "工具调用循环：shell、文件、搜索、任务、媒体生成。";
"The undistilled FLUX.2-klein 9B — more creative and varied than the fast distilled model, at the cost of many more steps (30+) and real guidance/negative-prompt control." = "未蒸馏的 FLUX.2-klein 9B —— 比快速蒸馏版更有创意、更多样，代价是步数多得多（30+），并支持真正的引导/反向提示词控制。";
