"Thinking" = "思考";
"Thinking · %@" = "思考 · %@";
"Thinking…" = "正在思考…";
"This Mac" = "这台 Mac";
"This agent can't answer until %@ is on disk. Nothing is downloaded automatically." = "%@ 下载到磁盘之前，这个 Agent 无法作答。不会自动下载任何内容。";
"This build can't self-update — install from the opened disk image" = "此构建无法自动更新 —— 请从已打开的磁盘映像安装";
"This can't be undone." = "此操作无法撤销。";
"This folder has a config but no usable model weights, so nothing can load it. It is safe to delete." = "该文件夹里有配置，但没有可用的模型权重，因此无法加载任何内容。可以安全删除。";
"This is in another app’s models folder.\n\nDelete %@?" = "此模型位于其他应用的模型文件夹中。\n\n删除 %@？";
"This is in the Hugging Face cache, where models share downloaded files. Deleting it can break other models that share the same files.\n\nDelete %@?" = "此模型位于 Hugging Face 缓存中，模型之间共享已下载的文件。删除它可能会破坏共用这些文件的其他模型。\n\n删除 %@？";
"This is one of the built-in agents. Duplicate it to make it yours." = "这是内置 Agent 之一。复制它即可改成你自己的。";
"This looks like a task for the agent (creating files, running commands, browsing the web…), but Tools is off. Turn it on so the model can use them?" = "这看起来像是交给智能体的任务（创建文件、运行命令、浏览网页…），但工具已关闭。要开启它，让模型可以使用这些工具吗？";
"This looks like it needs one of your MCP servers, but MCP mode is off. Enable it so those tools are available?" = "这看起来需要你的某个 MCP 服务器，但 MCP 模式已关闭。要启用它，让这些工具可用吗？";
"This model is %@. Click to unlock and delete it." = "这个模型%@。点击可解锁并删除。";
"This model is distilled for %@ steps; other values cost time without adding detail." = "该模型是按 %@ 步蒸馏的；其他步数只会耗时，不会增加细节。";
"This model is distilled for %lld steps; other values cost time without adding detail." = "此模型按 %lld 步蒸馏；其他取值只会更慢而不会增加细节。";
"This model is loaded and serving requests." = "该模型已加载并正在处理请求。";
"This model is serving %@ of context; the ladder needs %@. Raise it in Settings ▸ Context." = "当前模型提供 %@ 的上下文；阶梯测试需要 %@。请在设置 ▸ 上下文中提高。";
"This model isn't downloaded yet — use Download above." = "此模型尚未下载 —— 请使用上方的“下载”。";
"This model isn't downloaded yet." = "此模型尚未下载。";
"This model samples between %lld and %lld px per side. %lld is outside that." = "此模型每边采样 %lld 到 %lld 像素。%lld 超出了这个范围。";
"This model will load when you start the server." = "该模型会在你启动服务器时加载。";
"This model writes its own soundtrack. Describe it in the prompt after \"overall_soundscape:\" (and \"non_diegetic_music:\" for score)." = "这个模型会自行创作配乐。请在提示词中的 “overall_soundscape:” 后面描述它（配乐则写在 “non_diegetic_music:” 后面）。";
"This overwrites ~/.mlx-serve/system-prompt.md and the built-in skills in ~/.mlx-serve/skills with the latest versions. Anything you changed is backed up first so you can restore it." = "这会用最新版本覆盖 ~/.mlx-serve/system-prompt.md 和 ~/.mlx-serve/skills 中的内置技能。你改过的内容会先备份，以便恢复。";
"This permanently deletes everything the sandbox has downloaded and every change made inside it — installed agent CLIs (pi, hermes), their configs and logins, and any files outside the shared workspace. Any running guest and live sessions stop immediately.\n\nFiles in your workspace folder on this Mac are kept. This cannot be undone." = "这会永久删除沙盒下载的所有内容以及在其中所做的全部修改 —— 已安装的 Agent CLI（pi、hermes）、它们的配置和登录信息，以及共享工作区之外的任何文件。所有正在运行的客户机和活动会话都会立即停止。\n\n你在这台 Mac 上工作区文件夹中的文件会保留。此操作无法撤销。";
"This request needed %@ tokens, but the model's context window holds only %@." = "这次请求需要 %@ 个 Token，但模型的上下文窗口只能容纳 %@。";
"This request was larger than the model's context window." = "该请求超出了模型的上下文窗口。";
"This resets every section — Server, Speculative Decoding, Performance, Per-Request Defaults, Voice, Agent Sandbox and Messaging — not just the one you're looking at. Your Telegram bot token is kept, since only @BotFather can reissue it. The running server keeps its current flags until you hit Restart Now." = "这会重置每一个区块 —— 服务器、投机解码、性能、每请求默认值、语音、Agent 沙盒和消息 —— 而不只是你当前看到的那一个。你的 Telegram 机器人令牌会保留，因为只有 @BotFather 才能重新签发它。在你点击“立即重启”之前，正在运行的服务器会保留当前的启动参数。";
