"Voice mode can't hear you — Microphone access is off for MLX-Serve. Turn it on in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Microphone, then enable Voice again." = "语音模式听不到你 —— MLX-Serve 的麦克风访问权限已关闭。请在 系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 麦克风 中打开，然后重新启用语音。";
"Voice mode needs Speech Recognition access (a separate permission from Microphone). " = "语音模式需要语音识别权限（与麦克风分开的另一项权限）。 ";
"Voice mode needs Speech Recognition access (a separate permission from Microphone). Turn it on in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Speech Recognition, then enable Voice again." = "语音模式需要语音识别权限（与麦克风是两项独立权限）。请在 系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 语音识别 中打开，然后重新启用语音。";
"Voice mode transcribes on-device — your audio never leaves this Mac — but on-device " = "语音模式在设备端转写 —— 你的音频永远不会离开这台 Mac —— 但在设备端 ";
"Voice mode transcribes on-device — your audio never leaves this Mac — but on-device dictation isn't available for %@: it's either turned off or the language isn't installed. Turn on System Settings → Keyboard → Dictation (and add your language), then enable Voice again." = "语音模式在本机转写 —— 你的音频不会离开这台 Mac —— 但 %@ 无法使用本机听写：要么该功能已关闭，要么尚未安装对应语言。请打开 系统设置 → 键盘 → 听写（并添加你的语言），然后重新启用语音。";
"Voices blend: type several separated by commas (af_bella,af_sky) to make a new one." = "音色混合：输入多个以逗号分隔的音色（af_bella,af_sky）即可创建一个新音色。";
"Voices, lip sync and timing follow this clip — it becomes the video's soundtrack. Runs on the 2-stage pipeline." = "音色、唇形同步与时间轴都跟随这段音频 —— 它会成为视频的配乐。在 2 阶段流水线上运行。";
"WAV, MP3, M4A or AAC. The clip drives the performance and becomes the video's soundtrack." = "WAV、MP3、M4A 或 AAC。该片段驱动表演，并成为视频的配乐。";
