"For a GGUF with an MTP head (its own, or an mtp-*.gguf file beside it, as in unsloth's MTP folder), guess this many tokens ahead and check them in one pass: a faster reply with the same output. Drafts only while one request is decoding; with company the batch is faster. 0 turns it off and skips loading the head. Passes --llama-mtp-drafts." = "对带有 MTP 头的 GGUF（自带的，或旁边的 mtp-*.gguf 文件，例如 unsloth 的 MTP 文件夹），提前猜测这么多个 Token，并在一次传递中校验：回复更快，输出不变。只在单个请求解码时起草；有其他请求同时进行时，批处理更快。设为 0 关闭，并且不加载该头。对应 --llama-mtp-drafts。";
"Prefill batch size" = "预填充批大小";
"How many prompt tokens llama.cpp processes per GPU pass. Larger batches read long prompts faster, mostly on MoE models, and take more scratch memory. Default is llama.cpp's 512. Passes --llama-ubatch." = "llama.cpp 每次 GPU 传递处理多少个提示词 Token。批次越大，读取长提示词越快（主要是 MoE 模型），也占用更多临时内存。默认是 llama.cpp 的 512。对应 --llama-ubatch。";
